Z||000000||MikeSchaefer||01-03-2001||09:30 PM||||Hi, does anyone have instructions on how to move the battery to the front, without having to pay god-awful amounts of money for a little fiberglass piece to mount it on?  Does anyone offer a cheaper kit or something?<BR>Thanks,<BR>Mike S <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||7
